---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import companyData from '../../data/company.json';
---

<Layout
	title="Complete Golf Cart Guide for The Villages Residents | Masters Golf Cars"
	description="Everything you need to know about golf cart ownership in The Villages, FL. Learn about cart paths, local rules, registration, and the best carts for The Villages lifestyle."
>
	<!-- Hero Section -->
	<section class="bg-gray-900 text-white py-16">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4">
			<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
					<a href="/blog" class="text-brand-green hover:underline">Blog</a>
					<span class="text-gray-500">/</span>
					<span class="text-gray-400">Guides</span>
				</div>
				<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">Complete Golf Cart Guide for The Villages Residents</h1>
				<div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-gray-300">
					<span>By Masters Golf Cars</span>
					<span>|</span>
					<time datetime="2025-01-15">January 15, 2025</time>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Article Content -->
	<article class="py-16 bg-white">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4">
			<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
				<!-- Featured Image -->
				<div class="mb-12 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl">
					<img
						src="/images/home page carts/electric-golf-cart_img_v58.webp"
						alt="Golf cart on The Villages cart path"
						class="w-full h-[400px] object-cover"
					/>
				</div>

				<div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
					<p class="text-xl text-gray-700 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
						The Villages in Sumter County is the biggest golf cart town in the world. More than 100,000 golf carts drive here every day. There are over 100 miles of cart paths. If you live here or plan to move here, you need to know how golf carts work in this community. Masters Golf Cars has helped Villages residents for over 25 years. We know this area well.
					</p>

					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">The Cart Path System in The Villages</h2>

					<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
						The Villages has cart paths that go everywhere. You can get to Spanish Springs Town Square, Lake Sumter Landing, and Brownwood Paddock Square without driving on big roads. The paths connect homes, shops, golf courses, and doctors' offices. Many people never use their car at all.
					</p>

					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">What Makes The Villages Cart Paths Special</h3>

					<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-3 mb-8">
						<li><strong>Over 100 miles of paths</strong> - You can reach every part of The Villages</li>
						<li><strong>Tunnels under busy roads</strong> - Safe crossing under US-441 and US-27</li>
						<li><strong>Lights for night driving</strong> - Head to Spanish Springs for live music after dark</li>
						<li><strong>Smooth roads year-round</strong> - The Villages keeps paths in great shape</li>
						<li><strong>Speed limit of 20 mph</strong> - Keeps everyone safe on the paths</li>
					</ul>

					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Golf Cart Rules in The Villages</h2>

					<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
						The Villages has rules to keep people safe. Here is what you need to know before you drive your Club Car, Yamaha, EZ-GO, or Advanced EV golf cart.
					</p>

					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">How to Register Your Cart</h3>

					<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-3 mb-8">
						<li>You must sign up your cart with The Villages Community Development District</li>
						<li>Put the sticker on your cart where people can see it</li>
						<li>Pay the fee each year to keep your cart legal</li>
						<li>Street-legal carts may need proof of insurance</li>
					</ul>

					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Safety Items Your Cart Needs</h3>

					<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-3 mb-8">
						<li><strong>Headlights and taillights</strong> - You need these to drive to Lake Sumter Landing at night</li>
						<li><strong>Turn signals</strong> - Good to have if you drive on roads in Lady Lake or Summerfield</li>
						<li><strong>Mirrors</strong> - Most carts need at least one rearview mirror</li>
						<li><strong>Horn</strong> - Use it to warn people on the path ahead</li>
						<li><strong>Reflectors</strong> - Front, side, and back so others can see you</li>
					</ul>

					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Rules When You Drive</h3>

					<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-3 mb-8">
						<li>You need a valid driver's license to drive on public roads</li>
						<li>No drinking alcohol while driving your cart</li>
						<li>Go no faster than 20 mph on cart paths and 25 mph on marked roads</li>
						<li>Let walkers and bike riders go first</li>
						<li>Kids under 14 cannot drive and must ride with an adult</li>
					</ul>

					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Picking the Best Golf Cart for The Villages</h2>

					<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
						Not all golf carts work well in The Villages. Masters Golf Cars sells Club Car, Yamaha, EZ-GO, and Advanced EV carts. Here is what to think about when you buy.
					</p>

					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Electric Carts vs Gas Carts</h3>

					<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
						Most people in The Villages pick electric golf carts. Here is why they work so well:
					</p>

					<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-3 mb-8">
						<li><strong>Very quiet</strong> - Your neighbors in The Villages will thank you</li>
						<li><strong>Easy to care for</strong> - No oil changes or gas tank to fill</li>
						<li><strong>No smoke or smell</strong> - Better for clean air on the cart paths</li>
						<li><strong>Cheap to run</strong> - Plugging in costs less than buying gas</li>
						<li><strong>Great range</strong> - Most trips in The Villages are under 10 miles</li>
					</ul>

					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">How Many Seats Do You Need?</h3>

					<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
						Think about who will ride with you. Many Villages folks buy 4-seat or 6-seat carts for family and guests. Our <a href="/advent-4" class="text-brand-green hover:underline">Advent 4-seater</a> and <a href="/advent-6" class="text-brand-green hover:underline">Advent 6-seater</a> are top picks. When your grandkids visit, everyone can go to the Market of Marion together.
					</p>

					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Features Villages Residents Love</h3>

					<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-3 mb-8">
						<li><strong>Lithium batteries</strong> - Go farther, charge faster, no water to add</li>
						<li><strong>Air conditioning</strong> - A must for Florida summers in Sumter County</li>
						<li><strong>Windshield</strong> - Blocks rain and bugs on your way to Publix</li>
						<li><strong>Storage space</strong> - Room for groceries from Walmart or Winn-Dixie</li>
						<li><strong>USB ports</strong> - Charge your phone on the go</li>
						<li><strong>Good speakers</strong> - Listen to music on your ride to Brownwood</li>
					</ul>

					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Taking Care of Your Cart in The Villages</h2>

					<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
						A well-kept cart lasts longer and stays safe. Here are simple things you can do:
					</p>

					<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-3 mb-8">
						<li><strong>Check batteries monthly</strong> - Add water to lead-acid batteries, or get a <a href="/blog/lithium-battery-conversion-guide" class="text-brand-green hover:underline">lithium battery upgrade</a> so you never have to</li>
						<li><strong>Look at tires weekly</strong> - Check the air and look for worn spots</li>
						<li><strong>Test brakes monthly</strong> - Make sure they stop your cart well</li>
						<li><strong>Clean your cart often</strong> - Florida humidity can cause rust</li>
						<li><strong>Get a checkup each year</strong> - Masters Golf Cars offers full service</li>
					</ul>

					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Where to Go by Golf Cart in The Villages</h2>

					<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
						One of the best parts of living in The Villages is how much you can do by cart. Here are places you can reach:
					</p>

					<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-3 mb-8">
						<li><strong>Town Squares</strong> - Spanish Springs, Lake Sumter Landing, and Brownwood Paddock Square have food, shops, and live music every night</li>
						<li><strong>Golf Courses</strong> - Over 50 courses to play, all with easy cart access</li>
						<li><strong>Recreation Centers</strong> - Pools, gyms, and clubs for every hobby</li>
						<li><strong>Stores</strong> - Publix, Walmart, CVS, and more along US-441</li>
						<li><strong>Doctors</strong> - The Villages Health has offices all over</li>
						<li><strong>Restaurants</strong> - Hundreds of places to eat from fast food to fancy</li>
					</ul>

					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Buy Your Golf Cart at Masters Golf Cars</h2>

					<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
						Masters Golf Cars has served The Villages since 1999. We are on US-441 in Belleview, just a short drive south. We know what Villages residents need because many of our team members live here too. Here is what we offer:
					</p>

					<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-3 mb-8">
						<li>New and used Club Car, Yamaha, EZ-GO, and Advanced EV golf carts</li>
						<li>Custom builds with the features you want</li>
						<li><a href="/golf-cart-repairs" class="text-brand-green hover:underline">Repair and service</a> by trained experts</li>
						<li><a href="/the-villages-golf-cart-rentals" class="text-brand-green hover:underline">Golf cart rentals</a> when family visits</li>
						<li>Easy to reach on US-441 near Belleview, between Ocala and The Villages</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<!-- CTA Section -->
				<div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 text-center">
					<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Ready to Find Your Perfect Golf Cart?</h2>
					<p class="text-gray-300 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
						Come see us at Masters Golf Cars on US-441 in Belleview. We have helped The Villages residents for over 25 years. We will find the right cart for you.
					</p>
					<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
						<a
							href="/golf-cart-inventory"
							class="bg-brand-green text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold hover:opacity-90 transition"
						>
							Browse Inventory
						</a>
						<a
							href="/contact"
							class="bg-white text-gray-900 px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold hover:bg-gray-100 transition"
						>
							Contact Us
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Author Bio -->
				<div class="mt-12 p-6 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
						<img
							src="/images/logos/MastersGolfCarsLogo.png"
							alt="Masters Golf Cars"
							class="w-16 h-16 object-contain"
						/>
						<div>
							<p class="font-bold text-gray-900">Masters Golf Cars</p>
							<p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">
								Masters Golf Cars has served Central Florida since 1999. We sell, fix, and rent golf carts in The Villages, Ocala, Belleview, and all of Marion and Sumter County.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Related Posts -->
				<div class="mt-12">
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Related Articles</h3>
					<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
						<a href="/blog/lithium-battery-conversion-guide" class="block bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-100 transition">
							<h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Lithium Battery Conversion: Everything You Need to Know</h4>
							<p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Upgrade your golf cart with lithium batteries for better range and performance.</p>
						</a>
						<a href="/blog/electric-vs-gas-golf-carts" class="block bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-100 transition">
							<h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Electric vs Gas Golf Carts: Which Is Right for You?</h4>
							<p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Compare the pros and cons of electric and gas-powered golf carts.</p>
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</article>
</Layout>
